OL,3,GNEWSAPool man sacked for
OL,4,A'inadvertently' making mustard gas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA handyman who "inadvertently" created
OL,7,Fmustard gas, leading to a university
OL,8,Fpool and gym being evacuated, was
OL,9,Ffairly dismissed, a tribunal has found.
OL,11,FAnthony Brown, who worked for Pinnacle
OL,12,FFM, had been topping up chemicals and
OL,13,Ftesting pool water at the University of
OL,14,FHertfordshire when the incident
OL,15,Foccurred on 12 October 2024.
OL,17,FBrown, who had been employed by the
OL,18,Ffirm for seven years and had a "long,
OL,19,Funblemished service", was dismissed in
OL,20,FNovember 2024 following an internal
OL,21,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
