OL,3,GNEWSAPool man sacked for
OL,4,A'inadvertently' making mustard gas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn employment judge at the Watford
OL,7,Ftribunal found he "wilfully breached
OL,8,Fhealth and safety rules" and the
OL,9,Fincident could have been avoided.
